    "Id": "mechdef_lu_bu_LB-189",
    "Name": "Lu Bu LB-189",
    "Details": "As ER PPC quickly became hard to source, the Lu Bu LB-189 variant was designed as a continuation of the LB-182 variant with its Endo-Steel structure. Instead of the ER PPC it uses two standard PPCs, allowing it to drop three heat sinks. As a compensation for the lack of the new fancy ER PPC technology, the LB-189 instead uses a slightly upgraded in rating Extra-Light engine core. The changes allowed the addition of two Large Lasers which greatly increases its damage potential, but the variant was deemed far too expensive to be mass-produced.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Cooling Jacket - PPC</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "Hector"
  },
